  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Zone refining is used for the purification of indium.</p><p>Zone refining is based on the principle that the impurities are more&nbsp;soluble in the melt than in the solid state of the metal.&nbsp;</p><p>This method is&nbsp;very useful for producing semiconductor and&nbsp;other metals of very high purity, e.g.,&nbsp;germanium, silicon, boron, gallium.</p>",
